---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy: No Cookies | ImmigrationPoints.com" description="ImmigrationPoints.com sets no cookie, runs no analytics or tracker and stores none of the CRS or Australian points data you enter. Only GitHub logs remain.">
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-dark text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-90">How we handle your data and protect your privacy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-4">Our Commitment to Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      At ImmigrationPoints.com, we believe that access to immigration information should not come at the cost of your privacy. This privacy policy explains what data we collect (and do not collect) when you use our website and calculators.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Calculator Data</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      Our immigration points calculators run entirely in your web browser using client-side JavaScript. The personal information you enter into the calculators - including your age, education, language scores, work experience, and other factors - is processed locally on your device and is never transmitted to our servers. We do not collect, store, or have access to any data you enter into our calculators.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">No Audience Measurement, No Trackers</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      ImmigrationPoints.com runs no audience measurement tool and no tracker of any kind: no Google Analytics, no advertising network, no social media pixel, no session recording. We do not count you, profile you or follow you to other websites, and Radif Partners, the publisher, records no personal data about the people who check their Express Entry or SkillSelect points here.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      This website sets no cookie, on any page. The CRS and Australian points calculators keep nothing on your device either: your age, degree, IELTS or CELPIP results and years of work experience exist only in the open browser tab and disappear when you close it. Because nothing is stored and nothing is measured, there is no cookie banner on this site: there is nothing to accept or refuse.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Hosting and Server Logs</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      The site is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc.). Like any web server, GitHub automatically records technical request data in its logs, such as the IP address, date and time, page requested and browser type, to deliver the pages and protect the service against abuse. We do not use these logs to identify visitors; they are kept and handled by GitHub under its own privacy statement.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Email</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      If you write to <a href="mailto:contact@immigrationpoints.com" class="text-primary underline">contact@immigrationpoints.com</a>, we use your address and message only to reply, and delete the exchange once it no longer serves that purpose.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Data Sharing</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer any information to third parties. Since we do not collect personal data from our calculators, there is no personal data to share.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      Our website is not directed at children under the age of 16. We do not knowingly collect any personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so we can take appropriate action.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including the right to access, correct, delete, or port your data, and the right to object to certain processing activities. Since we store no personal data from the calculators or from your visit, there is usually nothing for us to retrieve; if you write to us, these rights apply to your email. Depending on where you live, you may also complain to your data protection authority, for example the Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada or the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Your continued use of the website after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      If you have questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, write to <a href="mailto:contact@immigrationpoints.com" class="text-primary underline">contact@immigrationpoints.com</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mt-8">Last updated: October 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
